## Layer 3 - Network (Summary):

- IP address (IPV4/v6) - cross networking addressing
- ARP - Find the MAC address, for the IP
- Route - Shows where the packet is fowarded
- Route table - Shows multiple routes
- Router - Moves packet from source to destination - Encapsulating in L2 on the way
- Device <> Device communicates over the internet
- No method for channels of communication only source and destination only (SRC and DST IP)
- Can be delivered out of order
